(text "BUCK - RAA211630  |  Renesas (Intersil)  |  4.5-60V 3A synchronous buck, HTSSOP-16" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 14.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c28dd027-6aa9-487c-9b2d-d9c2298143a8"))
(text "Default build: VOUT = 3.3 V (fixed resistor divider - no trimmer). Other outputs: change only R_top/R_bot (and L where shown) per the VOUT table." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 19.30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3d759796-fee4-46ea-a73d-5e90e461b8d1"))
(text "DESIGN EQUATIONS - RAA211630 (Renesas R16DS0178EU0101 Rev1.01, sections 5-6)\nDesign point: VIN 24 V nom (6-60 V), VOUT 3.3 V, IOUT 3 A, fSW 400 kHz, HTSSOP-16 (adjustable SS)\nFB divider (EQ.4): RFB1 = RFB2*(VOUT-0.8)/0.8, RFB2 = 20k -> RFB1 = 61.9k ; VOUT = 3.276 V\nFrequency: RFS = 261k -> 400 kHz (Table 1: 590k 200k, 374k 300k, 261k 400k, 205k 500k, 165k 600k, 121k 800k)\nInductor (EQ.6): L = 1000*VOUT(1-D)/(dIL*fSW[kHz]), dIL = 40% IOUT -> 5.93 uH ; Sec 2.3 table -> 6.8uH\n  dIL (EQ.5) = 1.05 A @24 V ; peak = 3.52 A (< HS peak limit 5 A)\nInput cap (EQ.7/8): IIN_RMS = IOUT*sqrt(D(1-D)) ; CIN = IOUT*D(1-D)/(fSW*dVIN)\nOutput cap: EQ.9 ripple (10 mV) 32.7 uF ; EQ.10 step-up 4.1 uF ; EQ.11 step-down 25.6 uF ; EQ.12 loop 65.9 uF\n  (ISTEP = 50% IOUT, dV = 5%) -> fitted 3x22uF 1210 (~50 uF eff) per Sec 2.3\nSoft-start (EQ.1): tSS = CSS*VREF/ISS = 10nF*0.8V/5.3uA = 1.51 ms (house-common 10 nF)\nUVLO (EQ.2/3): RIN1 = RIN2*(VINR-1.25)/1.25, RIN2 = 100k, VINR 6.0 V -> 383k ; VINF = 1.125*(RIN1+RIN2)/RIN2 = 5.43 V\nEBIAS tied to VOUT (3.3-40 V aux LDO) ; VCC 2.2uF ; BOOT 0.1uF ; PG 10k pull-up to VOUT (<=3.3 V)\nGENERIC CHECKS @ VIN=24V nom / 60V max, VOUT=3.3V, IOUT=3A, fSW=400kHz\n  D = VOUT/VIN = 0.137\n  dIL = VOUT(1-VOUT/VIN)/(L*fSW): 1.05A @nom, 1.15A @max  (38% of IOUT)\n  IL_PK = IOUT + dIL/2 = 3.57A ; inductor ISAT must exceed 6A (max peak limit)  (XAL6060-682ME: ISAT 9A)\n  ICIN_RMS = IOUT*sqrt(D(1-D)) = 1.03A (max IOUT/2 = 1.50A at D=0.5)\n  dVIN = IOUT*D(1-D)/(fSW*CIN) = 296mV with CIN_eff=3uF\n  dVOUT_ripple = dIL/(8*fSW*COUT) = 6.6mV with COUT_eff=49.5uF (ESR excluded)\n  tON @VINmax = VOUT/(VIN*fSW) = 137ns vs tON_MIN(max)=96ns -> OK\n  Max VIN without pulse skipping = VOUT/(tON_MIN*fSW) = 85.9V\n  Min VIN (dropout) ~ (VOUT+IOUT*R)/(1-fSW*tOFF_MIN) = 3.78V\nIC THERMAL @ VIN nom, full load (datasheet Power Dissipation / thermal sections)\n  Pcond=IL_RMS^2*1.4*(D*RDS_HS+(1-D)*RDS_LS)=0.88W, Psw=0.5*VIN*IOUT*tsw*fSW=0.22W (tsw~15ns), Pq=0.07W\n  RDS_HS=155mOhm, RDS_LS=55mOhm typ (datasheet EC table)\n  PIC = 1.16W ; thetaJA = 35 C/W (JEDEC) -> TJ = TA + thetaJA*PIC = 66C @25C, 126C @85C ; TA(max) for TJ=125C = 84C\n  Inductor DCR loss = IOUT^2*DCR = 0.23W" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 165.10 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e23967e7-cf94-4f4b-9721-d77c94c84ecd"))
